sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as Calon Penghuni
  participant FE as Flutter Frontend (Web/Mob)
  participant API as API Gateway / TenantResolver
  participant Room as Modul Room
  participant Sched as Modul Schedule Core
  participant EventBus as Internal Event Bus
  participant Fin as Modul Finance
  participant Mid as Midtrans Payment Gateway
  participant Notif as Modul Notification

  User->>FE: Pilih Gedung, Kamar & Periode Sewa
  FE->>API: POST /api/reservations (Header: X-Building-ID)
  API->>Sched: reserveRoom(buildingId, roomId, userId, dates)
  
  Note over Sched: DB Transaction & Pessimistic Lock<br/>SELECT ... FOR UPDATE (Anti Double Booking)
  Sched->>Sched: Simpan Schedule (status: 'reserved')
  Sched->>EventBus: emit(JadwalDibuat)
  
  EventBus->>Fin: handle(JadwalDibuat)
  Fin->>Fin: Generate Invoice (status: 'unpaid')
  Fin->>Mid: Request SNAP Token (with Idempotency-Key)
  Mid-->>Fin: Return SNAP Token & Redirect URL
  Fin-->>API: Return Invoice & Token
  API-->>FE: Return Envelope JSON (HTTP 201 Created)
  
  FE->>User: Tampilkan Antarmuka Pembayaran SNAP
  User->>Mid: Bayar via VA / QRIS
  Mid-->>Fin: Webhook Callback Settlement (SHA-512 Signature)
  
  Note over Fin: Verifikasi Signature SHA-512
  Fin->>Fin: Update Invoice (status: 'paid')
  Fin->>EventBus: emit(PembayaranDiterima)
  
  EventBus->>Sched: handle(PembayaranDiterima)
  Sched->>Room: Update Status Kamar ('terisi_sewa')
  Sched->>Sched: Update Schedule (status: 'active')
  
  EventBus->>Notif: handle(PembayaranDiterima)
  Notif->>User: Kirim Bukti Pembayaran via WhatsApp
